===Etymology===
From an earlier form *''parma'', probably [[onomatopoeic]]. Cognates include Estonian {{m|et|parm}}, Votic {{m|vot|paarma}}, Livonian {{m|liv|pārmaz}}, and Eastern Mari {{m|chm|pormo}}.<ref>{{R:Hakkinen 2004}}</ref>

